The following sources were consulted for hardware register meanings and board
configuration. Their licenses remain those stated in their respective sources.

1. Samsung SM7325 vendor kernel, drivers/thermal/tsens2xxx.c
   https://github.com/Bush-cat/android_kernel_samsung_sm7325/blob/HEAD/drivers/thermal/tsens2xxx.c
   Local research path:
   references/android_kernel_samsung_sm7325/drivers/thermal/tsens2xxx.c
   This reference bears GPL-2.0-only and Linux Foundation copyright notices.
   Facts used: TSENS enable and sensor-enable bits, first-round completion,
   sensor status offsets, validity bit, signed temperature encoding and scale,
   and the tsens26xx hardware family selection.

2. Samsung SM7325 vendor kernel, drivers/thermal/tsens.h and msm-tsens.c
   https://github.com/Bush-cat/android_kernel_samsung_sm7325/blob/HEAD/drivers/thermal/tsens.h
   https://github.com/Bush-cat/android_kernel_samsung_sm7325/blob/HEAD/drivers/thermal/msm-tsens.c
   Local research paths are under the same references directory.
   Facts used: the maximum of 16 hardware sensors, direct hardware sensor IDs,
   and calibration-resource handling. The selected SM-T733 DT has no TSENS
   EEPROM calibration resource, and the tsens2xxx operations have no software
   calibration callback.

3. SM-T733 firmware T733ZCS9DYE1 selected stock device tree
   Device-local ignored input:
   .cache/firmware/device-tree/T733ZCS9DYE1/selected-stock.dts
   The tsens@c222000 and tsens@c223000 nodes identify the actual SROT/TM
   resources and qcom,tsens26xx compatibility. CPU thermal zones and cooling
   maps inform the separate T733 board policy; no stock firmware binary or
   device-tree dump is distributed in this module.

4. Samsung SM7325 vendor kernel, drivers/thermal/qcom/cpu_voltage_cooling.c
   https://github.com/Bush-cat/android_kernel_samsung_sm7325/blob/HEAD/drivers/thermal/qcom/cpu_voltage_cooling.c
   This reference explains the shared CPU voltage cooling device used by the
   board's thermal maps. The module itself implements no cooling governor.
